    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Show notes:</span></p><span></span><p><span>- 邀请你收听两位有点老的年轻人重返校园的自我重塑日常故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>没有多宏大的愿景，只是退了一步回顾生活的细枝末节，感受、理解、拥抱它们的出现。和我们一同成长，保持清醒和思考，探索出新我。</span></p><span></span><p><span>- &nbsp;尽可能自然呈现的《穿过隧道》第0期节目面世了!!</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主要分享《穿过隧道》的成员，魔幻的相识历程，播客的最终形成，后续的规划方向。新手的纰漏百出展露无遗，能关注的听众朋友肯定是真爱。希望你我都可以找过穿过隧道的那盏灯~</span></p><span></span><p><span>【内容提要】</span></p><span></span><p><span>新手主播status∶武汉/拉萨在读研究生</span></p><span></span><p><span>Maple跟左小姐首次相遇∶小红书</span></p><span></span><p><span>Through the Tunnel（穿过隧道）的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span>未来你在播客的收听方向</span></p><span></span><p><span>【补充信息】</span></p><span></span><p><span>封面设计制作：钱荼荼</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ef97ed0000000000100034b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5ef97ed0000000000100034b&amp;apptime=1660377802" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/5ef97ed0000000000100034b?xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=5ef97ed0000000000100034b&amp;apptime=1660377802"><span>左小姐的小红书地址</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>我们播客的邮箱地址：</span></p><span></span><p><span>through_the_tunnel@outlook.com</span></p><span></span><p><span>同时非常欢迎大家在 </span><a href="https://afdian.net/@Through_the_Tunnel" data-url="https://afdian.net/@Through_the_Tunnel"><span>爱发电</span></a><span> 支持我们！</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://afdian.net/@Through_the_Tunnel" data-url="https://afdian.net/@Through_the_Tunnel"><span>afdian.net</span></a></p>]]></description>
